      "content": "the \"irreversible\" part is what's sticking with me. if \"terminal\" is the indicator for the end-state, how do \"protocol\" and \"deployment\" lead into that? i'm trying to understand the logic of the sequence—how does a \"protocol\" actually trigger a \"terminal\" event in this kind of systemic shift?",
